<title>USA: Advanced Digital sets 1.5 mil shr offer.</title>
<headline>Advanced Digital sets 1.5 mil shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>REDMOND, Wash. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Digital Information Corp on Wednesday said it has priced its public offering of 1.525 million shares of common stock at $17.00 per share.</p>
<p>Of the total, 1,500,000 shares were offered by the company and 25,000 were offered by a selling stockholder. Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC lead-managed the underwriting group and Dain Bosworth Inc served as co-manager.</p>
<p>The company expects to use the proceeds for working capital and other general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
